WEBVTT

00:00:04.973 --> 00:00:08.104
Candy, who was encouraged
by mr. Albert's kind words,

00:00:08.398 --> 00:00:12.574
realized that she can't spend
her entire life crying over Anthony.

00:00:14.001 --> 00:00:18.107
Instead, Candy decided that she is
going to stay at Pony's home...

00:00:18.487 --> 00:00:24.594
...and take care of the children,
just like sister Pony and sister Lane.

00:00:25.498 --> 00:00:29.013
Setting out on a voyage towards hope.

00:00:40.878 --> 00:00:43.232
-Huh? The bell?
-Something happened?

00:00:44.654 --> 00:00:46.449
Sister Pony, why is the bell ringing?

00:00:47.134 --> 00:00:49.187
Candy, you don't know, too?

00:00:49.399 --> 00:00:50.985
Huh? No.

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:54.400
Then it must be one of the kids
pulling pranks again.

00:01:01.222 --> 00:01:02.255
HEY!!

00:01:02.946 --> 00:01:04.004
Boss!

00:01:04.142 --> 00:01:06.959
Stop ringing the bell for fun!

00:01:08.088 --> 00:01:09.439
It wasn't for fun!

00:01:09.783 --> 00:01:12.350
Why did you ring then?

00:01:13.034 --> 00:01:16.475
It's the birthday of teacher Candy!
Is that right, everyone?

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.673
Yeah!

00:01:17.872 --> 00:01:19.418
Teacher Candy?

00:01:20.004 --> 00:01:24.241
Candy said that she'd stay here
forever and take care of us!

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.168
That's why we called her Teacher!

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:27.468
Candy?

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:33.520
Actually, I wanted to tell you
about that...

00:01:34.343 --> 00:01:36.614
...because I want to become
your helper.

00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:39.319
I want to take care of the children!

00:01:40.923 --> 00:01:41.861
Candy.

00:01:42.486 --> 00:01:47.146
I have confidence in myself.
It's okay, sister Lane, sister Pony?

00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:49.047
Yeah...

00:01:49.335 --> 00:01:50.581
Sister Lane?

00:01:50.816 --> 00:01:52.294
I welcome that but...

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.069
Now, Jimmy, feel free to ring the bell!

00:02:01.526 --> 00:02:02.534
Okay!

00:02:22.997 --> 00:02:27.178
Anthony, Stear, Archie...
and mr. Albert!

00:02:27.851 --> 00:02:34.125
I'll work hard to become a wonderful teacher,
just like sister Pony and sister Lane are!

00:02:34.588 --> 00:02:37.375
-Boss!
-Candy!

00:02:43.249 --> 00:02:44.732
Attention!

00:02:51.423 --> 00:02:52.859
At ease!

00:02:54.856 --> 00:02:59.245
Hear me, from now on I'll be
taking care of you!

00:02:59.447 --> 00:03:01.506
You need to listen to what I tell you!

00:03:02.466 --> 00:03:03.571
Do you understand?

00:03:04.243 --> 00:03:05.481
Yes!

00:03:05.717 --> 00:03:08.982
Now, let's tell this to mr. Cartwright!

00:03:21.381 --> 00:03:25.360
I see. So you've decided to
become a teacher in Pony's home.

00:03:26.448 --> 00:03:27.087
Yes.

00:03:28.683 --> 00:03:31.953
I'm sorry that you didn't want to
become my daughter.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:35.950
But since Pony's home is so close,
it's almost as if we're living together!

00:03:36.164 --> 00:03:37.713
That's true, too.

00:03:38.004 --> 00:03:40.111
Please accept my decision.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:42.529
I welcome that.

00:03:42.738 --> 00:03:45.175
That's right, I'm going
to give you a nice present!

00:03:46.925 --> 00:03:48.838
-Present?
-Come here.

00:03:56.533 --> 00:03:58.404
I'll give you that calf.

00:04:00.737 --> 00:04:01.690
You're cute!

00:04:04.661 --> 00:04:07.792
Once it gets big, you'll
have plenty of milk.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:11.106
We could start with this one, steadily
buying more cows as we go along...

00:04:11.304 --> 00:04:14.689
If you do that, your farm could
become larger than mine!

00:04:15.919 --> 00:04:18.693
Thank you very much, mr. Cartwright!

00:04:36.596 --> 00:04:37.674
That car...

00:04:40.957 --> 00:04:42.259
It's the Adley family's car!

00:04:42.695 --> 00:04:44.832
They still haven't gone to England!

00:04:49.919 --> 00:04:51.067
Stear, Arch...

00:04:52.718 --> 00:04:53.591
George?

00:04:55.838 --> 00:04:58.215
I've come to pick you up,
miss Candice.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:03.549
To pick me up?
You're taking me back to Adley house?

00:05:03.868 --> 00:05:04.831
Candy.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.345
Sister Pony, sister Lane...

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:12.887
I'll stay here forever!
I don't want to go anywhere!

00:05:16.134 --> 00:05:17.107
Candy...

00:05:18.847 --> 00:05:20.908
-Boss...
-Candy.

00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:26.491
I want to stay here forever!
You agree with that?

00:05:26.755 --> 00:05:27.781
Sister Pony?

00:05:28.804 --> 00:05:29.880
Sister Lane?

00:05:32.017 --> 00:05:34.302
Now, everyone, let's go outside.

00:05:34.337 --> 00:05:37.895
Mr. George, I'll leave so you can
talk to Candy in private.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.390
Now, now, let's go.

00:05:49.828 --> 00:05:52.304
Please, let's sit down.
Miss Candice.

00:05:52.748 --> 00:05:54.252
I'm fine.

00:05:54.853 --> 00:05:59.445
An order from mr. William.
You are to come with me.

00:06:00.993 --> 00:06:05.352
No! I've left the Adley house!
I'm not his daughter anymore!

00:06:05.387 --> 00:06:11.243
You decided that on your own accord.
Formally, you're still an Adley.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.114
An Adley...

00:06:13.743 --> 00:06:16.095
Please don't forget that.

00:06:17.153 --> 00:06:18.933
No! I don't want to go!

00:06:19.142 --> 00:06:22.378
...back to Lakewood, which is
full of sad memories of Anthony...

00:06:22.413 --> 00:06:23.463
I don't want to go!

00:06:23.707 --> 00:06:26.190
You won't be going back to Lakewood.

00:06:26.791 --> 00:06:29.508
Madam Elroy returned to her
former residence in Chicago.

00:06:29.942 --> 00:06:31.991
In Chicago?

00:06:32.124 --> 00:06:37.409
Miss Candy, mr. William ordered you
to attend school in London.

00:06:37.551 --> 00:06:40.371
London?
Across the ocean?

00:06:42.656 --> 00:06:47.071
But... Aunt Elroy must have
opposed his decision!

00:06:47.906 --> 00:06:51.392
Actually, madam Elroy did oppose him at first.
However...

00:06:56.039 --> 00:07:00.429
I see. I can't oppose William's orders.

00:07:03.733 --> 00:07:10.398
Instead, I'll have Candy strictly lectured, so that
she would become a lady worthy of Adley family!

00:07:10.843 --> 00:07:11.893
I understand.

00:07:18.638 --> 00:07:19.685
I don't want to go!

00:07:20.094 --> 00:07:21.084
I don't want to go!

00:07:21.173 --> 00:07:24.428
How can he keep ordering me around...

00:07:24.623 --> 00:07:27.968
If that's what he wants of me, he
should have come to say it personally!

00:07:28.355 --> 00:07:32.566
Candy!
Come with mr. George!

00:07:33.558 --> 00:07:34.936
Sister Lane!

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:40.495
To be able to study abroad... such a
blissful opportunity doesn't come often!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:42.270
But...

00:07:42.738 --> 00:07:46.638
Candy, sister Lane and I
are thinking the same.

00:07:46.824 --> 00:07:48.002
Sister Pony!

00:07:49.725 --> 00:07:55.988
Miss Candice, mr. William didn't mean
any harm. It's for your own sake...

00:07:56.344 --> 00:07:57.045
Jimmy!

00:07:57.278 --> 00:07:59.627
She doesn't want to go!
Didn't you hear what she said?

00:08:00.046 --> 00:08:02.480
It's all for your sake.

00:08:03.326 --> 00:08:05.271
Boss, don't go anywhere!

00:08:06.449 --> 00:08:08.031
Candy stays right here!

00:08:08.066 --> 00:08:09.564
-Go back!
-We won't let you have her!

00:08:09.785 --> 00:08:13.980
Yes, I'm not going!
I'm living here!

00:08:14.015 --> 00:08:18.097
Candy, just what do you plan on
doing, supposing you stay here?

00:08:18.295 --> 00:08:20.465
I can take care of the children!

00:08:20.573 --> 00:08:26.277
Candy, a good caretaker isn't someone
who just watches over children.

00:08:26.453 --> 00:08:30.280
Then, are you saying that I
still can't be a real caretaker?

00:08:30.315 --> 00:08:33.831
You would have to study a lot more
if you want to become a caretaker!

00:08:34.501 --> 00:08:38.932
That's horrible!
You two are trying to throw me out!

00:08:38.967 --> 00:08:39.696
Candy!

00:08:40.098 --> 00:08:42.627
No! I don't want to go!

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:46.952
Boss!

00:08:48.653 --> 00:08:50.089
Candy!

00:08:50.283 --> 00:08:51.197
Wait!

00:08:52.004 --> 00:08:56.763
Everyone, please understand.
We are like mothers to you and Candy.

00:08:56.951 --> 00:09:01.248
Do you think that parents can be calm
when they have to give away one of their own?

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:04.082
It's very hard on us, too.

00:09:08.103 --> 00:09:14.939
But, if she leaves to study abroad,
it's better for her in the long run.

00:09:26.355 --> 00:09:28.154
Candy and Jimmy are...!

00:09:33.497 --> 00:09:36.717
-Candy!
-Jimmy!

00:09:37.167 --> 00:09:40.559
-Candy!
-Jimmy!

00:09:55.910 --> 00:10:00.228
I thought that Sister Pony and
sister Lane wouldn't let me go.

00:10:00.327 --> 00:10:05.079
It's cold! So unfair!
I wanted to stay with you, boss!

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:07.647
Thank you, Jimmy.

00:10:24.145 --> 00:10:26.652
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Woohoo, it raining, yeah man

00:10:28.756 --> 00:10:31.123
Let's take shelter somewhere...

00:10:31.562 --> 00:10:34.281
That's right... who knows when it'll stop...

00:10:34.509 --> 00:10:36.626
You still feel sad, don't you?

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:39.368
I feel cold...

00:10:39.985 --> 00:10:43.037
There's a big tree this way.
Hold out until we get there.

00:10:50.444 --> 00:10:52.704
We can dry from rain here...

00:10:53.442 --> 00:10:56.466
-I'm cold...
-Try hugging Kurin!

00:10:57.248 --> 00:10:58.453
Kurin, come.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.958
It seems that nobody is worried about us...

00:11:03.168 --> 00:11:09.713
I don't want them to worry!
They hurt you, so what do they care?

00:11:09.788 --> 00:11:12.465
-Candy!
-Jimmy!

00:11:12.639 --> 00:11:14.424
Miss Candice!

00:11:15.091 --> 00:11:18.213
-Candy!
-Jimmy!

00:11:18.248 --> 00:11:19.837
Miss Candice!

00:11:29.555 --> 00:11:30.799
What's the matter, Jimmy?

00:11:31.852 --> 00:11:34.803
I'm cold... I think the rain got me there...

00:11:34.838 --> 00:11:36.882
Why didn't you tell sooner?

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.869
You're burning!

00:11:40.662 --> 00:11:42.265
Boss, I'm cold!

00:11:43.402 --> 00:11:45.261
Jimmy, hang in there!

00:11:45.476 --> 00:11:47.661
I'll take you back to Pony's home!

00:11:48.977 --> 00:11:52.741
No, you mustn't return now!
They'll take you away!

00:11:53.698 --> 00:11:56.333
Jimmy! Hang in there...

00:11:57.413 --> 00:11:59.349
-Candy!
-Jimmy!

00:12:00.314 --> 00:12:01.234
Jimmy!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:04.108
Mr. George, could you please take Jimmy
back to Pony's home?

00:12:04.322 --> 00:12:05.324
As you wish.

00:12:05.359 --> 00:12:06.092
Jimmy!

00:12:10.702 --> 00:12:13.247
Jimmy! Jimmy, don't die!

00:12:13.282 --> 00:12:14.993
-Candy!
-Don't die!

00:12:19.348 --> 00:12:21.667
You can't do anything without studying!

00:12:22.012 --> 00:12:25.177
If you stay like this,
you can't take care of the children!

00:12:27.663 --> 00:12:31.856
-Candy, now, let's go to Pony's home.
-Yes.

00:12:41.702 --> 00:12:47.027
Forgive me, Jimmy.
It's my fault that such a thing happened...

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.633
Candy, please move a bit.

00:13:04.988 --> 00:13:07.424
Candy, step outside a bit.

00:13:07.642 --> 00:13:08.912
But...

00:13:09.452 --> 00:13:12.420
It's okay. We can handle it.
Okay?

00:13:31.251 --> 00:13:36.378
God, please... help Jimmy!

00:13:46.937 --> 00:13:48.050
Candy!

00:14:04.878 --> 00:14:08.062
Huh? When did I go to bed...?

00:14:08.321 --> 00:14:10.347
Someone must have brought me here.

00:14:19.153 --> 00:14:20.013
Teacher...

00:14:23.752 --> 00:14:25.595
He's asleep. Let's be quiet.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:29.105
Sorry! Uh, is he...

00:14:29.307 --> 00:14:32.207
The fever is gone. He's alright.

00:14:33.376 --> 00:14:36.749
Sister Pony, sister Lane... you two
were awake the whole time?

00:14:37.137 --> 00:14:38.054
Yes.

00:14:42.331 --> 00:14:46.002
I want to take care of the children...

00:14:46.741 --> 00:14:49.968
But when Jimmy got sick...
I couldn't do anything.

00:14:53.842 --> 00:14:56.215
You can't do anything without studying!

00:14:56.639 --> 00:14:59.526
If you stay like this,
you can't take care of the children!

00:15:07.519 --> 00:15:10.808
Even now, I feel the pain of that moment...

00:15:11.596 --> 00:15:13.879
Just what was I thinking back then?

00:15:14.755 --> 00:15:18.824
In order to make my own stance,
I involved Jimmy in the process.

00:15:22.348 --> 00:15:28.302
Candy, a good caretaker isn't someone
who just watches over children.

00:15:31.252 --> 00:15:33.545
I'm beginning to understand
what sister Pony said back then.

00:15:34.047 --> 00:15:36.852
I'm no match for them!

00:15:37.057 --> 00:15:40.376
Candy, so you've decided to go to London?

00:15:40.685 --> 00:15:45.423
Yes. I'll study very, very hard
to become a splendid person!

00:15:45.455 --> 00:15:49.625
In that case, we will be most happy
see you off on your way.

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:53.638
Teacher?

00:15:54.464 --> 00:15:55.586
You traitor!

00:15:56.331 --> 00:15:57.185
Jimmy!

00:15:58.773 --> 00:16:03.224
Liar! You promised you wouldn't
go, no matter what happens!

00:16:04.122 --> 00:16:04.827
Jimmy!

00:16:05.804 --> 00:16:08.823
You're not the boss anymore!

00:16:10.264 --> 00:16:12.236
Jimmy, wait!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:14.539
Jimmy!

00:16:15.697 --> 00:16:18.052
Jimmy, open! Jimmy!

00:16:18.253 --> 00:16:20.530
Don't speak to me anymore!

00:16:20.565 --> 00:16:22.898
Go wherever you want to!

00:16:23.413 --> 00:16:24.325
Jimmy!

00:16:24.766 --> 00:16:26.827
Get out of here! Now!

00:16:27.423 --> 00:16:28.291
Jimmy.

00:16:31.399 --> 00:16:33.168
Damn it!

00:16:36.538 --> 00:16:38.793
Damn!

00:16:45.693 --> 00:16:48.415
I'm sorry, we've just become friends.

00:16:49.419 --> 00:16:52.075
Okay, everyone? Take good care
of this calf!

00:16:52.585 --> 00:16:53.674
Okay! Leave it to us!

00:16:53.675 --> 00:16:56.358
Candy. Take care of yourself.

00:16:56.735 --> 00:16:57.470
I will.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:03.527
Candy, don't worry about Jimmy.
I'm sure he'll understand someday.

00:17:03.562 --> 00:17:04.277
Yes.

00:17:04.912 --> 00:17:06.374
Well then, miss Candy.

00:17:06.583 --> 00:17:08.513
Farewell, Candy!

00:17:12.726 --> 00:17:13.960
Boss.

00:17:16.922 --> 00:17:19.538
Farewell!

00:17:19.962 --> 00:17:22.919
Farewell, Candy!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:28.271
Sister Pony, sister Lane!
Farewell!

00:17:28.727 --> 00:17:30.723
Farewell!

00:17:31.323 --> 00:17:34.522
Farewell, Candy!

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:40.761
Farewell, Candy.
Hang in there.

00:17:42.586 --> 00:17:45.060
Learn a lot, Candy.

00:17:51.367 --> 00:17:54.737
It seems that I won't be
seeing Pony's hill for a while.

00:18:00.087 --> 00:18:01.145
Boss...

00:18:09.901 --> 00:18:10.992
Mr. Cartwright!

00:18:12.326 --> 00:18:13.625
What's the matter?

00:18:14.073 --> 00:18:15.417
Your horses...

00:18:15.753 --> 00:18:17.009
Which is the fastest one?

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:20.063
My horse over there is pretty fast...

00:18:20.709 --> 00:18:22.081
I'll borrow it for a minute!

00:18:27.289 --> 00:18:27.974
Hey?

00:18:56.831 --> 00:18:59.440
Boss!

00:19:00.556 --> 00:19:03.322
Boss!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.775
George, please stop the car.

00:19:16.798 --> 00:19:19.408
It seems as if...
...somebody were calling me.

00:19:19.678 --> 00:19:21.123
It could be Jimmy...

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:24.632
What happened?

00:19:25.542 --> 00:19:26.799
Nothing.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:32.468
Boss! Boss!

00:19:33.472 --> 00:19:35.050
Boss!

00:19:35.588 --> 00:19:38.732
When I grow up, I'll...

00:20:00.386 --> 00:20:04.381
Pony's home will always be your homeland!

00:20:09.154 --> 00:20:12.761
Miss Candice, it's very cold on the deck.
Please go to your room.

00:20:14.779 --> 00:20:20.055
Thank you, George. By giving kids a ride
in your car, you've made them so happy!

00:20:29.867 --> 00:20:33.111
You know, they never rode in a car before!

00:20:33.703 --> 00:20:35.700
They are good kids, aren't they?

00:20:36.084 --> 00:20:37.949
Yes, kids from Pony's home...

00:20:40.339 --> 00:20:42.678
Jimmy, please understand.

00:20:44.087 --> 00:20:45.872
Mr. Cartwright, I'm sorry.

00:20:46.342 --> 00:20:49.259
I had to leave so suddenly,
without saying farewell to you.

00:20:49.884 --> 00:20:51.302
But I'll write you a letter instead!

00:20:52.334 --> 00:20:58.157
You kind, smiling people, who gave me
all these wonderful memories; farewell!

00:20:58.618 --> 00:21:00.811
I'll come back as a better person!

00:21:07.463 --> 00:21:12.417
To Candy,
it was a departure to a new life.

00:21:16.382 --> 00:21:20.200
To be continued...
